flowchart LR
  subgraph SIM[Simulated operational state]
    Crew[Generated crew biometrics and suit readings]
    Events[Mission events and alert lifecycle]
  end
  Shared[Shared dashboard state<br/>crew selection · mission status · alerts]
  Crew --> Shared
  Events --> Shared

  Shared --> Overview[Mission Overview]
  Shared --> Bio[Bio-Monitor]
  Shared --> Life[Life Support]
  Shared --> Medical[Medical Advisor simulation<br/>not diagnosis]
  Shared --> CrewAlerts[Crew and Alerts]

  Supabase[Supabase / PostgreSQL<br/>historical telemetry relation]
  History[Historical telemetry view<br/>separate source · bounded chart samples]
  Supabase -->|read-only browser queries| History
  History --> Bio
  History --> Life
  History --> Overview

  BioAstra[BioAstra deterministic command interface]
  Shared -. supported reads and navigation .-> BioAstra
  BioAstra -. confirmation before state changes .-> Shared

  classDef simulated fill:#fbf2f8,stroke:#bd82a5,color:#37172d
  classDef shared fill:#f7f4f6,stroke:#a992a1,color:#37172d
  classDef history fill:#f0f6fa,stroke:#83a8bd,color:#263f4e
  classDef view fill:#fff,stroke:#d8c7d2,color:#37172d
  class Crew,Events simulated
  class Shared shared
  class Supabase,History history
  class Overview,Bio,Life,Medical,CrewAlerts,BioAstra view
